theme_override_colors/font_color = Color(1, 1, 1, 1)
theme_override_fonts/font = ExtResource("2_pf1sy")
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 40
text = "YOU ARE AN ASTRONAUT FROM PLANET EARTH WHO HAS
BEEN SENT TO OUTER SPACE ON A MISSION.

DURING THE MISSION, YOUR ROCKET SHIP ENDS UP
CRASHING AND LANDS ON A STRANGE PLANET. 

YOUR JOB IS TO:
1. COLLECT ENOUGH SAMPLES FROM THE STRANGE PLANET
2. EXPLORE THE UNDERGROUNDS OF THE PLANET AND 
FIGHT ALIENS
3. AND DEFEAT THE LAST OF THE EVIL ALIENS ON
THE STRANGE PLANET

COMPLETE ALL OF THESE TASKS AND YOU WILL BE ABLE
TO SAFELY RETURN TO EARTH.

GOOD LUCK."
